-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Models and services
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

BiRefNet (background removal, downloaded by rembg on first use) is
licensed under MIT.

Image redraws are sent to OpenRouter and the model the user selects, under
those providers' own terms. Users supply their own OpenRouter API key.

Demucs model weights and FLUX.2 Klein weights (when run locally through
mflux) are downloaded on first use and are subject to their publishers'
licenses.
